	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type `l` followed by anything. The first row logs it; the rows below are the records that match, newest first. ↩ opens a record's file, ⇧↩ copies its text, ⌥↩ moves it to the Trash, ⌘↩ renames it. The hotkey object opens the same list; set its combination (HYPER+L is a good one) by double-clicking it.

Records are markdown files in the Log folder, one per line; their creation time is the file's creation time.</string>
